{"id": "lower-alemany-engineering-bid-protest", "title": "A runner-up’s protest changed the Lower Alemany engineering award", "seconds": 44.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "152854fee1638bbd", "words": 119, "beats": [{"scene": "s", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Three engineering teams competed to design a San Francisco flood project.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.32, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "won", "the", "bid?"], "sub": "Lower Alemany stormwater engineering"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.91, 1.28, 1.76, 1.9, 2.32, 2.42, 2.61, 3.16, 3.46]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The utilities commission posted a joint venture as its first choice.", "t0": 4.44, "t1": 8.44, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "alemany-selection", "kicker": "May 22 selection", "text": "Stantec/AGS", "mark": "Stantec"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.74, 1.17, 1.62, 1.72, 2.03, 2.6, 2.83, 2.99, 3.29]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The runner-up challenged that recommendation six days later.", "t0": 8.56, "t1": 11.21, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "6 days", "label": "From posted selection to protest"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.52, 0.93, 1.09, 1.78, 2.02, 2.29]}, {"scene": "s", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Officials checked the proposal again and upheld the protest.", "t0": 11.33, "t1": 14.75, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "alemany-puc", "kicker": "Commission resolution", "text": "Final Protest Determination", "mark": "Protest"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.57, 0.89, 1.0, 1.47, 1.81, 2.01, 2.38, 2.49]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The highest-scoring proposal had missed the minimum qualifications.", "t0": 14.97, "t1": 18.22, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "alemany-puc", "kicker": "November 20 determination", "text": "Minimum qualifications", "mark": "qualifications"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.79, 1.37, 1.59, 1.87, 1.99, 2.35]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Four commissioners awarded a different engineering firm the work.", "t0": 18.34, "t1": 21.33, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "4 votes", "label": "Commission award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.91, 1.32, 1.42, 1.76, 2.26, 2.52, 2.63]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The first contract authorized up to seven and a half million dollars.", "t0": 21.45, "t1": 24.74, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$7.5 million", "label": "Original contract ceiling"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.4, 0.9, 1.43, 1.57, 1.73, 2.03, 2.14, 2.22, 2.46, 2.79]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Three years later, supervisors approved additional design and permitting work.", "t0": 24.86, "t1": 29.29, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "alemany-leg", "kicker": "September 4 analysis", "text": "Engineering services", "mark": "Engineering"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.57, 1.1, 1.82, 2.3, 2.79, 3.25, 3.44, 3.89]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "A city audit examined one hundred twenty-four contracts. Fourteen drew protests.", "t0": 29.51, "t1": 34.25, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "14 of 124", "label": "Contracts with protests"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.41, 0.71, 1.19, 1.35, 1.6, 2.07, 3.15, 3.71, 3.95]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Auditors found this proposal should have been screened out before scoring.", "t0": 34.37, "t1": 37.74, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sfpuc-audit", "kicker": "Performance audit", "text": "Initial screening for compliance", "mark": "screening"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 0.72, 0.91, 1.41, 1.64, 1.78, 1.94, 2.33, 2.53, 2.87]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "They recommended annual training for the people who evaluate proposals.", "t0": 37.86, "t1": 41.18, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sfpuc-audit", "kicker": "Recommendation 6.1", "text": "Annual mandatory instruction and training", "mark": "training"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.79, 1.17, 1.5, 1.62, 1.73, 2.0, 2.12, 2.62]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 41.3, "t1": 43.67, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"s": "The posted selection", "r": "The reversal", "a": "The audit finding"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "number"}